      {
        "title": "Desserts and final verdict",
        "summary": "He tastes a wild-card dessert from each chain: Lawson's roll cake, FamilyMart's cream puff and 7-Eleven's cheesecake, and ranks them. He closes with an overall verdict on Japanese konbini versus US convenience stores.",
